ATTRIBUTIONS

The development pipeline methodology (grill-with-docs, domain-modeling,
to-spec, implement, handoff, writing-for-agents) is inspired by the
public work of Matt Pocock (aihero.dev). The concepts were reimplemented
independently, with no reproduction of the original text.

The skill format follows the Agent Skills specification published by
Anthropic
(https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/agents-and-tools/agent-skills).

